                "text": "Democrats are keeping the government shut down while demanding nearly $200B for healthcare for illegal immigrants \u2014 almost enough to fund the Children\u2019s Health Insurance Program for a decade. They should put America first and pass the House\u2019s clean funding bill to end this shutdown.",
