                "text": "House Republicans did our job. We passed a clean, no-strings funding bill to keep the government open.\n\nDemocrats? They\u2019ve now voted 7 times to keep it closed\u2014demanding taxpayer-funded health care for illegal immigrants and stuffing in $1.5 trillion in wasteful spending.\n\nWe stand united. Democrats chose a shutdown for their base, not for the American people.",
