                "text": "From improving Veterans\u2019 health care to quadrupling the SALT cap to securing funding for Brookhaven National Lab and protecting local jobs\u2014my record is clear: I deliver results for Long Island. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 https://t.co/0PEFivz84Z",
