                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Just months ago, Schumer warned that a shutdown would \u201cdelay benefits, reduce staff, and curtail mental health services\u201d for Veterans.\n\nNow he\u2019s doing exactly that\u2014abandoning the very heroes he claimed to protect, all to score political points. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 https://t.co/heaKthg1nF",
