                "text": "Even the nonpartisan Congressional Budget Office \u2014 rarely friendly to Republicans \u2014 now projects health insurance premiums will drop by 0.6% thanks to the integrity and accountability provisions in the One Big Beautiful Bill.\n\nWhy? Because when noncitizens and able-bodied adults stop getting taxpayer-funded Medicaid subsidies, demand falls and prices drop.\n\nThat\u2019s Econ 101 \u2014 and common-sense policy \u2014 at work.",
