                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m proud to back the common-sense, bipartisan CONNECT for Health Act. This bill delivers a win for Long Island seniors by permanently expanding telehealth access so Medicare enrollees can see a provider from the comfort of their home, including specialty physicians, mental health professionals, and community health providers from Stony Brook Medicine and clinics across Suffolk County.",
