                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Ensuring patients in Suffolk County nursing and long-term care facilities have access to on-site pharmacies, which offer 24/7 support, emergency delivery & medication management, is just common sense. If it takes an act of Congress to make that happen, I\u2019m proud to cosponsor it. https://t.co/RR3WEIBqiW",
