                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I voted for the Working Families Tax Cut because Americans shouldn\u2019t have to choose between paying bills and getting the care they need. \n\nBy expanding access to Health Savings Accounts within ACA plans, New Yorkers get more control over their healthcare dollars\u2014so they can save, plan, and make choices that work for them without being squeezed by rising costs.",
